      en: ["The park was established in 1963 as the first in France.", "The highest peak is Pointe de la Grande Casse at 3,855 meters.", "The core protected area spans approximately 528 square kilometers.", "There are more than 100 peaks over 3,000 meters in altitude.", "The park is home to around 2,600 Alpine ibexes.", "A total of 400 kilometers of marked hiking trails are available."],
